# 21. Final Product Definition

Runtrackr is a focused running performance tracker.

It helps recreational runners understand how their performance changes over time by calculating a score based on running speed and heart rate.

The core experience is simple:

**Record your runs. See your score. Track your progress.**

Version 1 should prioritize a reliable, understandable, and visually consistent experience over adding more features.

The goal is not to build another comprehensive fitness platform. It is to make one specific thing easier: understanding whether you're getting better at running.
